                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>: In Turkey Big Mac is 40 Liras, and AFV of Turkey is 60 Liras; in turn the AFV X -average price in terms of big macs is  60/40=1.5X</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Only vendors with </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>shop_type = &quot;restaurants&quot;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> are included.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- Item data for an entity is considered good if:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>        The share of items </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>priced above zero</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> is </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>more than 80%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>        and the share of items </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>priced above 5xBMI</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> is </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>less than 15%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>        and the share of items </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>priced above 10xBMI</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> is </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>less than 5%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- For entities considered, these items are </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>excluded</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>        Items </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>priced below 0.5xBMI</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> or </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>below the price at the 20th percentile, whichever is the highest</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>        Items </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>priced above 10xBMI</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>- In addition to the BMI-based item exclusion, the following filtering is used:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
