                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>        Going from top to bottom, only the items with contributions to the &quot;top&quot; 75% of the restaurant&apos;s GMV.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>        As the &quot;top&quot; 75% of the GMV can be provided with a smaller percentage of items, many items from the long tail may get excluded by this rule.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
